{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo sits at the docks while Lucy flies around, curious of everything. He takes a long sigh as he starts looking up to the ships above.\n Lucy let's out a whimpering cry when Bo see's Sonny's ship. He hadn't speant too much time around Fuddles, but he remembers the look on both of their faces when they took the blast. A look of determination to save their friends, protecting them.\n Lucy begins to hop around the docks happily as Bo remembers the fun times he had with Sonny.\n Bo's expression dramatically changes when he thinks about Eliza, another he couldn't save. Lucy headbutts Bo's cheek, trying to get his attention and nuzzles his cheek as Bo begins to feel like everything will be ok, maybe.\n A moment of silence ends as Lucy jumps off his shoulder like a pouncing cat. Lucy begins casting light in an array of colors all around the docks as she flies around, before landing on Bo's head. \nShe purrs as her eyes glow with many colors. \"Yeah. Ok... I get yer point.\" Bo smiles with laughter and begins to play his banjo.","created_at":"2021-08-01T05:25:23.001000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"871262314303737906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
